{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Animal Style",
    "steam_appid": 3797260,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/755750862dab7b6b7cdf3049be467ecf.poster.avif?t=1755017597\" width=438 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/755750862dab7b6b7cdf3049be467ecf.webm?t=1755017597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/755750862dab7b6b7cdf3049be467ecf.mp4?t=1755017597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your own hotdog shop and become a master sauce-slinger in <strong>Animal Style!</strong> Fulfill orders for your hungry (or sometimes <i>hangry</i>) customers as you learn the art of Sauce Balancing. Discover and sauce all 60 unique objects, it's not as easy as it sounds! Harness the power of sauce to drive away the evil hivemind and save the city once and for all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep your balance...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/986c06829104fe6ff4fb5a2f5a488929.poster.avif?t=1755017597\" width=434 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/986c06829104fe6ff4fb5a2f5a488929.webm?t=1755017597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/986c06829104fe6ff4fb5a2f5a488929.mp4?t=1755017597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using <strong>realistic fluid physics</strong>, sauce anything you can imagine, and some things you can't. Balance a variety of objects while adding the required sauces, and try not to let the sauce fall off! Progress at your own pace as you become a master of Sauce Balancing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Befriend the regulars, and sauce 'em up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The residents of Pawston come in different shapes and sizes. Some are furry, some are robotic. Some are serious, some are totally zany. They all have their own stories, and they all need their sauce.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save the city from a dry, sauce-less future...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/999855d5e8704f81e89aff99793c6930.poster.avif?t=1755017597\" width=436 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/999855d5e8704f81e89aff99793c6930.webm?t=1755017597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/999855d5e8704f81e89aff99793c6930.mp4?t=1755017597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city is in danger, and sauce is the cure. Can you harness all the sauces to defeat the evil invaders and save the city from a dry, sauce-less future? Use the patent-pending Sauce Soaker to repel evil. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money to upgrade your sauce bottles and kegs. Progress though the perk board to unlock all the sauces, as well as some fun extras! Decorate the shop. Print memes. Play the xylophone. Use the arcade machine to re-sauce any object you have encountered. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/755750862dab7b6b7cdf3049be467ecf.poster.avif?t=1755017597\" width=438 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/755750862dab7b6b7cdf3049be467ecf.webm?t=1755017597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/755750862dab7b6b7cdf3049be467ecf.mp4?t=1755017597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your own hotdog shop and become a master sauce-slinger in <strong>Animal Style!</strong> Fulfill orders for your hungry (or sometimes <i>hangry</i>) customers as you learn the art of Sauce Balancing. Discover and sauce all 60 unique objects, it's not as easy as it sounds! Harness the power of sauce to drive away the evil hivemind and save the city once and for all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep your balance...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/986c06829104fe6ff4fb5a2f5a488929.poster.avif?t=1755017597\" width=434 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/986c06829104fe6ff4fb5a2f5a488929.webm?t=1755017597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/986c06829104fe6ff4fb5a2f5a488929.mp4?t=1755017597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using <strong>realistic fluid physics</strong>, sauce anything you can imagine, and some things you can't. Balance a variety of objects while adding the required sauces, and try not to let the sauce fall off! Progress at your own pace as you become a master of Sauce Balancing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Befriend the regulars, and sauce 'em up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The residents of Pawston come in different shapes and sizes. Some are furry, some are robotic. Some are serious, some are totally zany. They all have their own stories, and they all need their sauce.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save the city from a dry, sauce-less future...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/999855d5e8704f81e89aff99793c6930.poster.avif?t=1755017597\" width=436 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/999855d5e8704f81e89aff99793c6930.webm?t=1755017597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/999855d5e8704f81e89aff99793c6930.mp4?t=1755017597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city is in danger, and sauce is the cure. Can you harness all the sauces to defeat the evil invaders and save the city from a dry, sauce-less future? Use the patent-pending Sauce Soaker to repel evil. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money to upgrade your sauce bottles and kegs. Progress though the perk board to unlock all the sauces, as well as some fun extras! Decorate the shop. Print memes. Play the xylophone. Use the arcade machine to re-sauce any object you have encountered. </p>",
    "short_description": "A goofy restaurant simulator, with SAUCE as the main ingredient! Use realistic fluid physics to sauce a huge variety of foods, objects, robots and furry customers! Manage your hotdog shop, unlock upgrades, save the city, and make sure not to lose your balance....",
